Package: bgmfiles
Title: Example BGM Files for the 'Atlantis' Ecosystem Model
Version: 0.1.0.9004
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael D.", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hadley", "Wickham", role = "ctb"),
    person("Department of Climate Change, Energy, the Environment and Water",
           role = "cph", comment = "Australian Antarctic Division")
    )
Description: A collection of example box geometry model (BGM) files for the
    'Atlantis' ecosystem model. 'Atlantis' is a deterministic,
    biogeochemical, whole-of-ecosystem model (see
    <https://research.csiro.au/atlantis/> for more information). A BGM file
    describes the spatial boxes and the faces between them that 'Atlantis'
    uses for its model domain. The package provides a single function to find
    the installed files; the files are kept as originally supplied.
